# A crew cost's creatures are chosen once the mana abilities have been activated (CR 601.2g-h by way of 602.2b). Bot2's
# Anointed Peacekeeper names Smuggler's Copter, so Bot1's crew 1 costs {2} more. Bot1 crews it and pays the {2} with Mox
# Emerald and Llanowar Elves, its only creature: the Elves are tapped for {G}, and no untapped creature is left to tap
# for crew. The cost can't be paid (CR 601.2h): the activation is taken back (CR 733.1) - the Copter is no creature, the
# Mox and the Elves untapped, the pool empty. Then Bot1 pays the {2} with two Moxen instead and taps the Elves to crew.

